{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>ולא יתן</b> Three times in the Masorah; and the other, ולא יתן עליה לבונה, in the passage of the sin-offering — for by the merit of the sacrifices they were saved. And the other, in the passage of the suspected wife: ולא יתן עליה לבונה — for by the merit of righteous women they went out from there, and this one who did not do as their deeds — her offering shall not be adorned."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:36.728094061Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}